			"notes": "-Added Aether compat, use moa eggs to bake, incubate duck eggs, and make coffee with skyroot buckets\n- Apple pie has been added, eat slices or take them for later use, each pie has 6 slices\n- Apple logs are now part of the log group\n- Bushes will now work in infinite winter worlds\n- Duck eggs will now appear on the server when thrown\n- Tomatos can be thrown!\n- Activators now consume bonemeal\n- Lang has been tweaked to make the trellis more clear\n- Tall crops will no longer float\n- Farmland now checks for stardew crops above to see if they can dry out\n- Stardew blocks now have map colors\n- Honey block is no longer opaque\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/LukeisStuff/stardew-farming-bta/compare/3.4.3...3.5.0"
